WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:22.650
Knowing how to do something does not always mean you may do it. Clear communication depends on an accurate claim about what you are able and permitted to do. You may be able to edit a diary or a supplier record. The ability to use the system is different from permission to make the decision. We will use four separate checks before accepting work: competence, authority , information/access and capacity.
